                <div class="center"> 

                    <h2 align="center"> TELANGANA NURSING COUNCIL </h2> 
                    <p> <span class="style1"><span class="style2"><b>TELANGANA NURSES AND MIDWIVES COUNCIL</b>  is    an Autonomous Statutory   Registration  body constituted  under the Andhra Pradesh  Nurses and  Midwives  (Extension &amp; Amendment)  Act, 1964 and  adapted  to the state of  Telangana,  Vide  G.O.Ms.No. 80,  HM &amp; FW (F1) Dept. Dt. 26.09.2015. </span></span></p>
                    <span class="style2"><br></span>
                    <p class="style2"><span class="style2">TGNMC aim is to  establish  a  uniform standard of education for Nurses,  Midwives  and  Auxiliary  Nurse  midwives  and   Health Visitors in the state of Telangana.</span> </p>
                    <span class="style2"><br></span>
                    <p class="style2"><span class="style2">Our Mission is to prepare safe competent,  compassionate Nursing professionals  for  life- long  learning,  evidence-based  practice, Autonomous Administration and social commitment. </span> </p>
                    <br>
